-- openspec/changes/002-add-invoicing/proposal.md --
# Add invoicing

## Why
The `billing` capability does not yet exist.

-- openspec/changes/002-add-invoicing/specs/billing/spec.yaml --
capability: billing
deltas:
  - op: ADDED
    requirement:
      name: Invoice generation
      text: The system SHALL generate an invoice at the end of each billing period.
      scenarios:
        - name: Invoice generated on schedule
          given:
            - an active billing period ends
          when:
            - the billing job runs
          then:
            - the system SHALL generate an invoice for the account

