-- openspec/changes/003-mfa/proposal.md --
# Add MFA

## Why
Tighten login further.

-- openspec/changes/003-mfa/specs/auth/spec.yaml --
capability: auth
deltas:
  - op: MODIFIED
    requirement:
      name: Password login
      text: The system SHALL allow a registered user to authenticate with a username and password, now with rate limiting.
      scenarios:
        - name: Successful login with correct password
          given:
            - a registered user with a known password
          when:
            - the user submits the correct username and password
          then:
            - the system SHALL grant an authenticated session

